{
  "FormatVersion": 3,
  "Id": "65643c65-e4d9-524d-98ea-7ee6b4257cbc"/*VolumeNanoVdbSaveExample*/,
  "Description": "Exports a NanoVDB file from a generated volume while previewing the same data on the GPU.\n\n[VolumeToNanoVdb] feeds the preview in [NanoVdbRender], and [SaveNanoVdb] writes the same volume to disk when Save is switched on. The file is readable by the reference NanoVDB library.\n\nAKA: export nvdb, write nanovdb, openvdb interchange\n\nTips\n- Set PathSaved on [SaveNanoVdb] to the target file, then toggle Save.\n- Save writes on the rising edge only; switch it off and on to write again.",
